pan begin="2:02.870" end="2:03.176">до</span><span begin="2:03.176" end="2:03.830">стей</span> <span begin="2:03.830" end="2:04.136">дур</span><span begin="2:04.136" end="2:04.730">ман</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊，世间的欢乐，欢愉的迷醉</span></p><p begin="2:05.142" end="2:12.372" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.142" end="2:05.756">Та</span><span begin="2:05.756" end="2:06.064">ют</span> <span begin="2:06.064" end="2:06.724">слов</span><span begin="2:06.724" end="2:07.038">но</span> <span begin="2:07.038" end="2:07.602">сно</span><span begin="2:07.602" end="2:07.902">ви</span><span begin="2:07.902" end="2:08.584">де</span><span begin="2:08.584" end="2:08.876">нье,</span> <span begin="2:08.876" end="2:09.514">слов</span><span begin="2:09.514" end="2:09.852">но</span> <span begin="2:09.852" end="2:10.496">у</span><span begin="2:10.496" end="2:10.812">трен</span><span begin="2:10.812" end="2:11.434">ний</span> <span begin="2:11.434" end="2:11.756">ту</span><span begin="2:11.756" end="2:12.372">ман</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是像梦与晨雾一般转瞬即逝</span></p><p begin="2:12.737" end="2:18.993" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.737" end="2:13.727">Но</span> <span begin="2:13.727" end="2:14.123">ро</span><span begin="2:14.123" end="2:14.251">ди</span><span begin="2:14.251" end="2:14.627">на</span> <span begin="2:14.627" end="2:15.234">ждёт,</span> <span begin="2:15.234" end="2:15.571">что</span> <span begin="2:15.571" end="2:16.021">мы</span> <span begin="2:16.021" end="2:16.141">по</span><span begin="2:16.141" end="2:16.493">свя</span><span begin="2:16.493" end="2:17.109">тим</span> <span begin="2:17.109" end="2:17.431">ей</span> <span begin="2:17.431" end="2:18.107">юн</span><span begin="2:18.107" end="2:18.445">ые</span> <span begin="2:18.445" end="2:18.715">жиз</span><span begin="2:18.715" end="2:18.993">ни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的朋友，让我们把心中美好的激情，呈现给我们的家园</span></p><p begin="2:19.400" end="2:27.590" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.400" end="2:19.962">Там,</span> <span begin="2:19.962" end="2:20.248">где</span> <span begin="2:20.248" end="2:20.578">мир</span> <span begin="2:21.238" end="2:21.838">пал</span> <span begin="2:21.838" end="2:22.146">во</span> <span begin="2:22.146" end="2:22.618">прах,</span> <span begin="2:23.166" end="2:23.766">там</span> <span begin="2:23.766" end="2:24.072">на</span> <span begin="2:24.072" end="2:24.672">кам</span><span begin="2:24.672" end="2:25.018">не</span> <span begin="2:25.018" end="2:25.648">впи</span><span begin="2:25.648" end="2:25.970">шут</span> <span begin="2:25.970" end="2:26.592">нас</span> <span begin="2:26.592" end="2:26.908">в ве</span><span begin="2:26.908" end="2:27.590">ка</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在旧世界的废墟上，将铭刻我们的名字</span></p><p begin="2:27.920" end="2:34.168" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:27.920" end="2:28.506">Пусть</span> <span begin="2:28.506" end="2:28.828">тре</span><span begin="2:28.828" end="2:29.262">пе</span><span begin="2:29.262" end="2:29.450">щет</span> <span begin="2:29.450" end="2:29.766">ти</span><span begin="2:29.766" end="2:30.328">ран,</span> <span begin="2:30.440" end="2:30.718">что</span> <span begin="2:30.718" end="2:31.176">слу</span><span begin="2:31.176" end="2:31.288">ча</span><span begin="2:31.288" end="2:31.626">ем</span> <span begin="2:31.626" end="2:32.240">был</span> <span begin="2:32.240" end="2:32.600">от</span><span begin="2:32.600" end="2:33.080">ме</span><span begin="2:33.080" end="2:33.230">чен</span> <span begin="2:33.230" end="2:33.560">ка</span><span begin="2:33.560" end="2:33.846">приз</span><span begin="2:33.846" end="2:34.168">ным!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">战栗吧，无常的命运的暴君呀！</span></p><p begin="2:34.558" end="2:44.924" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.558" end="2:35.090">О</span> <span begin="2:35.090" end="2:35.420">дру</span><span begin="2:35.420" end="2:35.826">зья,</span> <span begin="2:36.074" end="2:36.404">от</span><span begin="2:36.404" end="2:36.996">брось</span><span begin="2:36.996" end="2:37.348">те</span> <span begin="2:37.348" end="2:37.746">страх,</span> <span begin="2:38.000" end="2:38.300">стрях</span><span begin="2:38.300" end="2:38.878">ни</span><span begin="2:38.878" end="2:39.224">те</span> <span begin="2:39.224" end="2:39.868">сон,</span> <span begin="2:39.868" end="2:40.198">у</span><span begin="2:40.198" end="2:40.828">слышь</span><span begin="2:40.828" end="2:41.136">те</span> <span begin="2:41.136" end="2:42.088">глас</span> <span begin="2:42.088" end="2:42.944">от</span><span begin="2:42.944" end="2:43.266">чиз</span><span begin="2:43.266" end="2:44.924">ны!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朋友们，鼓起勇气，站起来，醒来吧！</span></p></div></body></tt>